From cdbd9792ef0954de5a3e1e44461ec524c9823c8d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mahitha M <mmaddulu@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 14:21:34 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] Adding End to End descriptor to prplmesh

Signed-off-by: Mahitha M <mmaddulu@qti.qualcomm.com>
---
